{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Interests and Aspirations"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Sally and Life Coaching"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le04ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future Time Clauses: if, When"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use  <span class=\"strong\">time clauses</span> to give information about time and sequence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">If </span>or  <span class=\"italic\">When </span>to give an information about a sequence of events in the future. <span class=\"strong\">Future time clauses</span> explain what needs to happen or which condition needs to be satisfied before a future event can occur."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">first conditional</span> with these <span class=\"strong\">time clauses</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure: <br/> If/When+ Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will/be going to + Simple Present tense"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">If </span>means on the condition that ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If</span> I go home early, I will watch a movie.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">When </span>means at the time of doing something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">When</span> I finish my work, I will leave.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> you can commit to being here for five sessions, you will reach a level of contentment by learning techniques to facilitate."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> I finish this course, I feel that positive change will be possible."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Future Continuous Tense: Will  and Going to"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I will be working at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are two ways to use the Future Continuous tense:</br/></br/><ul> <li>You use the Future Continuous to indicate that a longer action in the future will be interrupted by a shorter action in the future. </li></ul> Structure: will + be + present participle of the verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">We<span class=\"strong\"> will be doing </span>exercises on discovering your inner strength, and that discovery will lead to true success."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I am going to to give you the tools to make your life fuller and more rewarding. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "With five sessions you are going to expand your potential, reduce stress, learn to sustain your successes."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rewarding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "satisfying"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am going to give you the tools to make your life fuller and more rewarding."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about self-improvement."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to expand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to grow larger"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With five sessions you are going to expand your potential, reduce stress and learn to sustain your success."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "essentially"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "basically"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Essentially, there is no magic here. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "contentment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "satisfaction"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you can commit to being here for five sessions, you will reach a level of contentment."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "peace of mind"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "mental calm "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We teach learning techniques to facilitate relaxation and peace of mind."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hold oneself back"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stop oneself from doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Furthermore, I always feel I am holding myself back from doing my best. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to boost one's self esteem"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to raise one's confidence"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I experience anxiety and also need to boost my self esteem."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "at any rate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "anyway"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: At any rate, I guess I feel ready to change a few things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to open up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to expand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I feel ready to change a few things and just open up to new possibilities."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go to the library or online to find a course on self-improvement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Take notes on what the course offers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell a friend what you will be doing and learning in the course if you take it."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research and read about a self-improvement course."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write notes about the course."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I tell a friend what I will be doing in the course."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I support my ideas accurately."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le04ob01re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le04ob01re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy:</span> Good morning everyone, and welcome to your first session of life-coaching! Before we start with our session today, I'll introduce myself. I'm Amy Watson. I'm going to give you the tools to make your life fuller and more rewarding. With five sessions you are going to expand your potential, reduce stress, learn to sustain your success, and nurture your relationships. Essentially, there is no magic here. We will be doing exercises on discovering your inner strength, and that discovery will lead to true success. If you can commit to being here for five sessions, you will reach a level of contentment by learning techniques to facilitate relaxation and peace of mind.", "id": 1}, {"time": "38000", "image": "engenn10le04ob01re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi everyone. I'm Vanessa. A lot of my ideas seem to be changing since my friend Sally moved away. I work in  a restaurant. More specifically, I am the manager. While I love my job and working with food, I'm hoping to realize my full potential. Furthermore, I always feel I'm holding myself back and that I would benefit from a course such as this one. When I finish this course, I feel that positive change will be possible.", "id": 2}, {"time": "70000", "image": "engenn10le04ob01re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Thanks Vanessa, and what about you?", "id": 3}, {"time": "71500", "image": "engenn10le04ob01re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Will</span>: Hi. I'm Will. Although it's taken me some time to reach the decision to come here, I feel quite pleased to be with you today. I will be heading to South Asia to teach in a couple of months, but have realized I experience anxiety and also need to boost my self-esteem.  At any rate, I guess I feel ready to change a few things and just open up to new possibilities. When I gain a little more confidence, I am going to propose to my girlfriend.", "id": 4}, {"time": "96000", "image": "engenn10le04ob01re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: That's great Will.  How about the next person ...", "id": 5}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le04ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le04ob01re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1}], "id": 0, "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions"